// IntroString :
"P181483677" "Do you see that mountain off in the distance, {HeroName}? People around these parts call it Vampyr Mountain. It's home to the Council's deadliest soldiers, the vampyri. They're genetically enhanced super soldiers, and they're more than a little scary. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to go out into the Bonny Morass and see if you can clear out some of the vampyri and their human companions.</a> But be careful, {HeroName}. They are the deadliest of men."
